         '<rect x="160" y="195" width="680" height="82" rx="14" class="s-box-a"/><text x="195" y="229" class="s-t-b">CHANGE THE CATALYST, '
         'NOT THE PERSON</text><text x="195" y="255" class="s-t-sm">ask, acknowledge, offer bounded choices, show evidence, let them '
         'decide</text>\n'
         '<path d="M127 125 L220 195" class="s-line" marker-end="url(#ah)"/><path d="M367 125 L355 195" class="s-line" '
